{"time": 1758198348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931893800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "最终你们击败了褴褛者以及赞达鲁斯，疗养院附近的雾气也自然而然的消散了，为了查询过去的记忆，也为了找劳尔斯要个说话，你们决定和温特一起前往瑟拉什摩爾，劳尔斯爵士所在的地方"}
{"time": 1758198392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620556762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（好）"}
{"time": 1758198399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894204381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（导完了么）"}
